msgid "**Name**: ``OpenCitations_get_references``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/opencitations_tools.rst:97 525325364fa34d1d8e983d9da4caafc9
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get the list of papers cited by a given scientific "
"article (its reference list) using OpenCitations COCI index. "
"OpenCitations is a free, open scholarly citation database derived from "
"CrossRef. Returns citation links with DOIs, publication dates, and time "
"spans between publications. Useful for citation analysis, bibliometrics, "
"and understanding research impact."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/opencitations_tools.rst:101 359e151c600b4112bf7b446de7444e78
msgid ""
"``doi`` (string) (required) DOI of the paper to get references for. Do "
"not include 'https://doi.org/' prefix. Examples: '10.1002/jcc.21224', "
"'10.1038/nature12373'"
msgstr ""

